Package: codex-usage-tray
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Łukasz Budzynowski <lbudzynowski@gmail.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1, systemd
Homepage: https://github.com/lbudzynowski/codex-usage-tray
Description: Ubuntu tray indicator for OpenAI Codex usage limits
 Unofficial GTK 3 AppIndicator application that reads usage limits from
 the local Codex app-server and displays the remaining allowance in the
 Ubuntu GNOME top panel.
 .
 OpenAI Codex must be installed and authenticated separately.
